# The context is the whole repo, and .git alone is over a gigabyte of artwork
# history. Deny everything, then name what the image needs - README.md and
# LICENSE among them, since hatchling reads both for the wheel's metadata.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!assets

# Re-excluded from the trees above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
